OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785212281
OL,3,CShop price inflation slows amid
OL,4,Cwarnings of pressures on the horizon
OL,6,FShop price inflation slowed in July in
OL,7,Fpositive news for households, but
OL,8,Fgrowing pressures remain on the
OL,9,Fhorizon, the industry has warned.
OL,11,FShop prices are now 0.9% higher than a
OL,12,Fyear ago, down from June's 1.2%,
OL,13,Faccording to British Retail Consortium
OL,14,F(BRC)-NIQ figures.
OL,16,FInflation on products other than food
OL,17,Falso fell to 0.2% from June's 0.6%.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
