PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785212281
OL,3,CShop price inflation slows amid
OL,4,Cwarnings of pressures on the horizon
OL,6,FWhile food price inflation also fell
OL,7,Fto 2.2% from 2.4% a month earlier,
OL,8,Ffresh food inflation rose to 3.1% from
OL,9,FJune's 2.8% in June.
OL,11,FHowever, shoppers benefited from deals
OL,12,Fon snacks and alcoholic drinks during
OL,13,Fthe football World Cup, while clothing
OL,14,Fand footwear retailers offered
OL,15,Fsignificant discounts as they started
OL,16,Fclearing summer stock.
OL,18,FSome categories, including electricals
OL,19,Fand health and beauty, saw higher
OL,20,Finflation as rising chip prices and
OL,21,Fmanufacturing costs fed through.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
