OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785212281
OL,3,CShop price inflation slows amid
OL,4,Cwarnings of pressures on the horizon
OL,6,FBRC chief executive Helen Dickinson
OL,7,Fsaid: "Good news for households in
OL,8,FJuly as shop price inflation slowed.
OL,10,F"Retailers competed hard to limit
OL,11,Fprices rises, with a wave of summer
OL,12,Fpromotions across food and other goods.
OL,14,F"While today's figures are
OL,15,Fencouraging, growing cost pressures
OL,16,Fremain on the horizon.
OL,26,@oD@GOUrD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785212281
OL,3,CShop price inflation slows amid
OL,4,Cwarnings of pressures on the horizon
OL,6,F"Higher employment costs and packaging
OL,7,Ftaxes, global instability and climate-
OL,8,Frelated disruption all make it more
OL,9,Fexpensive to get products onto
OL,10,Fshelves."
OL,12,FMike Watkins, head of retailer and
OL,13,Fbusiness insight at NIQ, said: "Shop
OL,14,Fprice inflation remains lower than a
OL,15,Fyear ago, which will help shoppers as
OL,16,Fthey manage other increases in
OL,17,Fhousehold spend, such as energy and
OL,18,Ffuel.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@IO]uD@`OU
