OL,3,CShop price inflation slows amid
OL,4,Cwarnings of pressures on the horizon
OL,6,F"So, we can expect promotions to
OL,7,Fcontinue to be an important part of
OL,8,Fdriving demand for the rest of the
OL,9,Fsummer."
